QURAN INTEGRITY NOTICE

This project is completely free and open source and is created with respect for
the Holy Quran and with the intention of making Quranic content freely
accessible for everyone.

You are free to use, copy, modify, fork, publish, and distribute this software
under the MIT License.

However, Quranic verses and Islamic content must be treated with respect and
care. Please do not intentionally alter, manipulate, fabricate, or misrepresent
Quranic verses or present modified text as authentic Quranic text.

Changing a verse, altering its meaning, combining it with unrelated content,
or presenting modified content as an authentic Quranic verse can seriously
mislead people.

If you believe that I have written something incorrectly or that there is an
error in any Quranic verse, translation, transliteration, reference, or other
Islamic content in this project, please contact me:

witrfaruk.vercel.app/social

I welcome corrections and feedback. If you find an error, please provide the
relevant verse, reference, and correction so it can be reviewed and corrected.

This project is intended to remain completely free and open source and is made
with the intention of providing accurate and responsible access to the Holy
Quran.
